===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately borrowed from {{bor|lv|la|India}}, itself from {{etyl|grc|lv}} {{m|grc|Ἰνδία}}, from {{m|grc|Ἰνδός||Indus River}}, from {{etyl|peo|lv}} {{m|peo|𐏃𐎡𐎯𐎢𐏁|tr=hi<sup>n</sup>dūš}} ({{cog|fa|هند|tr=Hend}}) from {{etyl|sa|lv}} {{m|sa|सिन्धु||a river, stream|tr=síndhu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|lv|lv-riga-Indija.ogg}}

